    "body": "The existing-save bypass is now handled. With Single GF enabled, each field or world-map entry checks all eight character GF masks. A mask with several GFs is cleared completely; empty and one-GF masks stay unchanged. The Settings warning now states this consequence. Static byte, stride, and normalization checks pass. Please use the first player check in the revised issue body on a backup or test save; this cleanup is not yet player-confirmed.",
